OL,3,ABurnham hails Greenland deal ahead of
OL,4,Aexpected first Trump meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FNato previously said the agreement
OL,7,Fwould help stabilise the region, while
OL,8,FTrump declared Denmark would grant the
OL,9,FUS "permanent control over security,
OL,10,Fand all other needs" in the
OL,11,Fsemi-autonomous Danish territory in the
OL,12,FArctic.
OL,14,FBurnham's comments come as he is
OL,15,Fexpected to meet Trump for the first
OL,16,Ftime at the UN General Assembly (UNGA)
OL,17,Fin New York this week.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
